{"unit_id":"tag:08LE:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed space）。我们定义一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的态射列（sequence of morphisms）<MATH_0002>，它们是<MATH_0003>的增厚，称为一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>复形（complex）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若理想层（ideal sheaves）<MATH_0004>之间的相应映射（maps）给出一个<MATH_0005>模（modules）的复形（complex）<MATH_0006>（即复合（composition）为零）。在此情形下，复合（composition）<MATH_0007>经由<MATH_0008>分解（factors），即一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0009>，它是<MATH_0010>的增厚，是平凡（trivial）的，并且附有典范（canonical）平凡化（trivialization）<MATH_0011>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n我们称一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的态射列（sequence of morphisms）<MATH_0012>，它们是<MATH_0013>的增厚，为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>一个短正合列（short exact sequence）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若理想层（ideal sheaves）之间的相应映射（maps）是一个短正合列（short exact sequence）<MATH_0014>，它是<MATH_0015>模（modules）的列。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"sequence of morphisms","target_term":"态射列"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"ideal sheaves","target_term":"理想层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"sequence of morphisms","target_term":"态射列"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"ideal sheaves","target_term":"理想层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_