{"unit_id":"tag:08LI:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的态射（morphism），如情形<REF_0001>中所示。令<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>模（module），并置<MATH_0004>。假设<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上平坦（flat），且<MATH_0007>是增厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism）（定义<REF_0002>）。那么以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>上平坦（flat），且\n<STRUCT_0003>典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0010>是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n此外，在此情形下，映射（maps）<MATH_0011>是同构（isomorphisms）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚涉及的空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给的增厚。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"增厚之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模的相对平坦性。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"平方零扩张。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"前节定义的严格条件。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个条件等价。"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"所示自然映射。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"自然映射的性质。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"结论中的映射。"},{"source_