{"unit_id":"tag:08LJ:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为一阶增厚（first order thickenings）的态射（morphism），如情形<REF_0001>中所示。令<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>模（modules），并置<MATH_0005>与<MATH_0006>。令<MATH_0007>为一个<MATH_0008>线性（linear）映射（map）。假设<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>上平坦（flat），且<MATH_0011>是增厚（thickenings）的严格（strict）态射（morphism）。<MATH_0012>到<MATH_0013>线性（linear）映射（map）<MATH_0014>的提升（lifts）的集合（set），若非空（nonempty），则是<MATH_0015>下的一个主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"增厚之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"结构层上的线性性质。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所给与所提升映射。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模的相对平坦性。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"平方零增厚。"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"前述严格性。"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升","context":"映射的提升。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"提升的集合。"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空","context":"提升存在的条件。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","targ