{"unit_id":"tag:08LK:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间（ringed spaces）的一阶增厚（first order thickening）。令<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>模（modules），并置<MATH_0005>与<MATH_0006>。令<MATH_0007>为一个<MATH_0008>线性（linear）映射（map）。存在一个元素（element）<MATH_0009>，其消失（vanishing）是存在<MATH_0010>到<MATH_0011>线性（linear）映射（map）<MATH_0012>的提升（lift）的充要条件（necessary and sufficient condition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚所在空间。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给平方零增厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定两个模。"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"结构层线性。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定与提升映射。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"障碍群的元素。"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失","context":"障碍为零。"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升","context":"映射的提升。"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件","context":"提升存在的判据。"}],"notes":[]}
